# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

Material Design 3 Qt Quick app generated by **md3-create**.

| | |
|--|--|
| Qt | {{QT_VERSION}} ({{QT_KIT}}) |
| QML URI | `{{QML_URI}}` |
| Template | `{{TEMPLATE}}` |
| Md3 | `./Md3` (same directory as this CMakeLists.txt) |

## Layout

```text
{{PROJECT_NAME}}/
  CMakeLists.txt
  Main.qml
  Md3/                 # packaged library (fixed relative path)
    lib/
    include/
    lib/cmake/Md3/
```

CMake always loads Md3 from `${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}/Md3`.

## Build

```bash
cmake --preset default
cmake --build build
```

Or with Qt Creator: open `CMakeLists.txt` and configure the matching kit.

## Run

```bash
./build/{{TARGET_NAME}}
```

## Theme

```qml
Md3Theme.dark = true
Md3Theme.applySeed("{{SEED_COLOR}}")
```
